CinemaUQ "1" o-- "0..*" Pelicula
CinemaUQ "1" o-- "0..*" Sala
CinemaUQ "1" o-- "0..*" Funcion
CinemaUQ "1" o-- "0..*" Producto
CinemaUQ "1" o-- "0..*" Combo
CinemaUQ "1" o-- "0..*" Promocion
CinemaUQ "1" o-- "0..*" Compra

' ---------- Cliente y tarjeta ----------
Cliente "1" *-- "1" TarjetaVirtual
